  "body_html": "<h1>index_split_existence</h1>\n<h2>Lean type</h2>\n<p><code>lean\nlemma index_split_existence (k : Fin (total_card card)) : ∃ (p : Σ i, Fin (card i)), prefix_sum card p.1 ≤ k.val ∧ k.val &lt; prefix_sum card p.1 + (card p.1 : ℕ) ∧ p.2.val = k.val - prefix_sum card p.1</code></p>\n<h2>Dependencies</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Profile.ext</li>\n</ul>",
